  "event_preview": "The Streets of Washington is a 1.700-mile (2.736 km), 7-turn temporary street circuit around the National Mall in Washington, D.C., passing landmarks including the Washington Monument and the United States Capitol. The Freedom 250 Grand Prix of Washington, D.C. was the 15th race of the 2026 NTT IndyCar Series season and IndyCar's inaugural visit to the capital, scheduled for 147 laps (250 miles), lengthened from the original 125 laps (212.5 miles), on Sunday, August 23 as part of America's 250th anniversary. It was the first major motor race in Washington, D.C. since the 2002 Grand Prix of Washington D.C. American Le Mans Series event, and the last street race of the 2026 calendar before the Milwaukee Mile double-header and the Laguna Seca finale.\n\nAlex Palou entered as championship leader with four races remaining, 133 points clear of Kyle Kirkwood. Palou had six wins on the season; Josef Newgarden and Christian Lundgaard had two apiece, while Kirkwood, Pato O'Ward, Marcus Ericsson and Indianapolis 500 winner Felix Rosenqvist each had one. Ericsson had won the previous round on the Streets of Markham for Andretti Global, with Romain Grosjean and Will Power completing the podium. Twenty-five full-time entries were listed, with no one-off additions.\n\nAs IndyCar's first visit to the Streets of Washington, there were no prior series qualifying or race lap records.",
  "event_preview_ru": "Streets of Washington — временная 7-поворотная уличная трасса длиной 1,700 мили (2,736 км) вокруг National Mall в Washington, D.C., с видом на Washington Monument и United States Capitol. Freedom 250 Grand Prix of Washington, D.C. стал 15-м этапом сезона NTT IndyCar Series 2026 и первым визитом IndyCar в столицу, планировался на 147 кругов (250 миль; удлинён с изначальных 125 кругов / 212,5 мили) в воскресенье, 23 августа, в рамках 250-летия США. Это была первая крупная автогонка в Washington, D.C. после этапа American Le Mans Series Grand Prix of Washington D.C. 2002 года и последняя уличная гонка календаря 2026 перед double-header на Milwaukee Mile и финалом на Laguna Seca.\n\nAlex Palou приехал лидером чемпионата при четырёх оставшихся этапах, с отрывом 133 очка от Kyle Kirkwood. У Palou было шесть побед в сезоне; Josef Newgarden и Christian Lundgaard — по две, а Kirkwood, Pato O'Ward, Marcus Ericsson и победитель Indianapolis 500 Felix Rosenqvist — по одной. Ericsson выиграл предыдущий этап на Streets of Markham за Andretti Global, подиум дополнили Romain Grosjean и Will Power. Заявлено 25 полносезонных машин, без гостевых заявок.\n\nПоскольку это первый визит IndyCar на Streets of Washington, исторических квалификационных и гоночных рекордов серии ещё не было.",
